# My Deals — Unified Business Work Queue



> **CO-ARCH-003:** My Deals = **lender Deal queue only**.  

> Requirement queue = **My Opportunities** (`/my-opportunities` — Opportunity Registry).  

> Do not expand LoanFile-as-both patterns.



## Purpose



My Deals is the operational home for RMs and business users **for lender execution**.



- **My Opportunities** = requirement queue (Opportunity Registry)

- **My Deals** = lender Deal queue (Deal Registry)

- **Opportunity Workspace** = requirement workspace with child Deals  

- **Calendar / Planner** = future Tasks module — do **not** add Calendar to My Deals



## Primary nav



See Architecture Freeze in `navigation-architecture.mdc` (includes My Opportunities before My Deals).



## Architecture (transitional)



- Vertical tabs (Loans live; MF / Insurance / etc. placeholders)

- Views only: **Kanban | List | Table** (data presentation modes)

- Transitional rows may still derive from LoanFile until Phase 3–5 cutover

- Target open path: Opportunity id and/or Deal id (not LoanFile-as-both)



## Extending



Add a business vertical = new tab in `MY_DEALS_BUSINESS_TABS` + data adapter. No nav redesign.

Align new adapters with CO-ARCH-003 (Opportunity ≠ Deal).

